                "text": "<p>ButlerWood is a commercial cooking wood supplier serving restaurants, steakhouses,<br/>pitmasters, and food businesses across the country. We deliver <a href=\"/collections/cooking-wood\" title=\"Cooking Wood\">premium wood for smoking</a>,<br/>grilling, and wood-fired cooking, including post oak, hickory, mesquite, pecan, apple, and cherry.<br/>More than 300 restaurants nationwide run their pits on our wood because every split lands the<br/>same way: consistent size, low moisture content, and a clean, steady burn. We cut and age our<br/>own wood in Texas and haul it on our own trucks, so the supply you count on never depends on<br/>a middleman. Choose a way to shop below.</p>",
